From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:11:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: own SCS and per-client MSCS state

Implement the final SCS rule store and per-client MSCS learning engine directly. Keep RCU lifetime, garbage collection, configured-rule precedence and offload refresh semantics without the intermediate single-MSCS model.

Split from:
  440-wifi-mac80211-classify-transmitted-MSDUs-with-SCS.patch - wifi: mac80211: classify transmitted MSDUs with SCS
  441-wifi-mac80211-learn-MSCS-flows-on-receive.patch - wifi: mac80211: learn MSCS flows on receive
  443-wifi-mac80211-add-the-sta_set_scs-driver-op.patch - wifi: mac80211: add the sta_set_scs driver op
  448-wifi-mac80211-add-a-flow-priority-query.patch - wifi: mac80211: add a flow priority query
  449-wifi-mac80211-add-the-flow-offload-flush-op.patch - wifi: mac80211: add the flow offload flush op
  450-wifi-mac80211-keep-learned-MSCS-entries-of-offloaded.patch - wifi: mac80211: keep learned MSCS entries of offloaded flows
  467-wifi-mac80211-keep-an-MSCS-per-client-and-configured.patch - wifi: mac80211: keep an MSCS per client and configured flag

Merged from:
  439-wifi-mac80211-add-SCS-and-MSCS-rule-storage.patch - wifi: mac80211: add SCS and MSCS rule storage
  440-wifi-mac80211-classify-transmitted-MSDUs-with-SCS.patch - wifi: mac80211: classify transmitted MSDUs with SCS
  441-wifi-mac80211-learn-MSCS-flows-on-receive.patch - wifi: mac80211: learn MSCS flows on receive
  442-wifi-mac80211-apply-MSCS-on-transmit.patch - wifi: mac80211: apply MSCS on transmit
  443-wifi-mac80211-add-the-sta_set_scs-driver-op.patch - wifi: mac80211: add the sta_set_scs driver op
  448-wifi-mac80211-add-a-flow-priority-query.patch - wifi: mac80211: add a flow priority query
  449-wifi-mac80211-add-the-flow-offload-flush-op.patch - wifi: mac80211: add the flow offload flush op
  450-wifi-mac80211-keep-learned-MSCS-entries-of-offloaded.patch - wifi: mac80211: keep learned MSCS entries of offloaded flows
  467-wifi-mac80211-keep-an-MSCS-per-client-and-configured.patch - wifi: mac80211: keep an MSCS per client and configured flag

